{"id":"ef09f4563b20da8e","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-finite-lfp.md","title":"有限单调迭代的收敛与最小性","display":"thm-finite-lfp — 有限单调迭代的收敛与最小性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-finite-lfp","aliases":["29-thm-finite-lfp"],"display":"thm-finite-lfp — 有限单调迭代的收敛与最小性","depends_on":[],"source_locator":"Theorem 4.3, p.58, DjVu scan 73","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-finite-lfp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-finite-lfp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-lfp — 有限单调迭代的收敛与最小性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 4.3, p.58, DjVu scan 73"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)\">\\(F:\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 单调：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall X,Y\\subseteq U\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\to F(X)\\subseteq F(Y))\">\\(\\forall X,Y\\subseteq U\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\to F(X)\\subseteq F(Y))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0\\coloneqq\\varnothing\">\\(X_0\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{i+1}\\coloneqq F(X_i)\">\\(X_{i+1}\\coloneqq F(X_i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad X_i\\subseteq X_{i+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad X_i\\subseteq X_{i+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists r\\leq|U|\\quad X_r=X_{r+1}=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}X_i=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq U\\mid F(Y)\\subseteq Y\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists r\\leq|U|\\quad X_r=X_{r+1}=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}X_i=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq U\\mid F(Y)\\subseteq Y\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall r\\in\\mathbb N\\quad(X_r=X_{r+1}\\to\\forall Y\\subseteq U\\;(F(Y)=Y\\to X_r\\subseteq Y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall r\\in\\mathbb N\\quad(X_r=X_{r+1}\\to\\forall Y\\subseteq U\\;(F(Y)=Y\\to X_r\\subseteq Y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 4.3，印刷页 58，扫描页 73；将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=|A|^k\">\\(U=|A|^k\\)</span> 的证明抽象到任意有限载体。已核对该页证明：由单调性归纳得递增链，每次严格增长至少加入一个新元素，故不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|U|\">\\(|U|\\)</span> 次；对任意前不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i\\subseteq Y\">\\(X_i\\subseteq Y\\)</span>。每一个稳定阶段的值都满足最小性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall X,Y\\subseteq U\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\to F(X)\\subseteq F(Y))","display":false},{"tex":"X_0\\coloneqq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"X_{i+1}\\coloneqq F(X_i)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\quad X_i\\subseteq X_{i+1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists r\\leq|U|\\quad X_r=X_{r+1}=\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}X_i=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq U\\mid F(Y)\\subseteq Y\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall r\\in\\mathbb N\\quad(X_r=X_{r+1}\\to\\forall Y\\subseteq U\\;(F(Y)=Y\\to X_r\\subseteq Y)).","display":true},{"tex":"U=|A|^k","display":false},{"tex":"|U|","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"X_i\\subseteq Y","display":false}],"bytes":1344,"backlinks":[{"id":"3f8441c5cf2fdcc5","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本轮把绑定数据 $R,\\bar x$ 纳入全部深度签名，不能只用公式体的字面形式决定迭代。反例：$\\varphi=R(x)\\lor x=y$，$R$ 一元且域至少两元；绑定 $x$、固定 $y$ 时一轮稳定，绑定 $y$、固定 $x$ 时两轮稳定。迭代构造也显式携带绑定数据，避免复用丢失参数的缩写。正性使更新算子单调，[[29-thm-finite-lfp]] 给出最小稳定阶段存在及 $n^k$ 上界。"},{"id":"70bd97a5960cba9e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书 Theorem 4.3 与 Definition 4.5，印刷页 58–59，扫描页 73–74。对公式结构归纳可知正性蕴含单调性；收敛和最小性由 [[29-thm-finite-lfp]] 保证。本条只在有限结构上定义，未把可数次迭代的结论延伸到任意无限结构。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-finite-lfp]] — 有限单调迭代的收敛、最小性与轮数界"},{"id":"bc2571aa42af9da2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X_0=\\varnothing$、$X_{i+1}=F(X_i)$ 见 [[29-thm-finite-lfp]]；$I_i^F$ 和 $\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)$ 见 [[29-df-ifp]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-finite-lfp]]"},{"id":"bfe1be5f707cc63a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-finite-lfp|29-thm-finite-lfp]]"}],"outgoing":[]}